    "gp_section_573701165955417152": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "a0e61cd57bbcd5164c50e48d0904b661d30858fca08d70c7492a1895a5a08371_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg2oEGQLRWK_text": "<p>- Bryan L</p>",
        "gg3raFLe5u4_text": "<p>LIKED IT SO MUCH BOUGHT ANOTHER!</p>",
        "ggB_GDx5VtQ_text": "<p>I mainly bought this for layering over the 150 and under the vest or Hardscrabble jacket. With that combination I have been perfect in mid 30’s in middle Georgia. &nbsp;It breathes well and retains heat when used layering. You owe it to yourself to try SKRE clothing. You will not be disappointed in the quality or customer service</p>",
