        "ggFaZHpYlcV_text": "<p>- Joshua P.</p>",
        "ggFj8cxFm_4_text": "<p>Exceptional quality and extreme comfort in a lightweight material. I love the fit.</p>",
        "ggJ2cbaTgzQ_text": "<p>Very nice hoodie. High quality, liked it so much I bought a second one. Fits good as a base layer, or size up for a everyday use</p>",
        "ggO8SS4bsT4_text": "<p>- Aaron C.</p>",
        "ggOVehLtMLT_text": "<p>Comfy &amp; Stylish</p>",
