        "ggV2d07527S_text": "<p>- Ryan S.</p>",
        "ggc7OS61yIl_text": "<p>- Matthew H.</p>",
        "ggef-PWsPHC_text": "<p>- Aaron C</p>",
        "ggh0gmtEVyu_text": "<p>Liked it so much bought another!</p>",
        "ggj3NKoizaL_text": "<p>Very Nice hoodie. High quality, liked it so much I bought a second one. Fits good as a base layer, or size up for a everyday use.</p>",
        "ggn3qWMJTUT_text": "<p>FITS GREAT, KEEPS ME WARM</p>",
        "ggnK7jggEZO_text": "<p>Amazing fit, quality, and pattern. Super warm on cool morning and a great part of a layering system for cold temps. Super soft material, comfortable hood that fits over a hat or beanie, and long enough to use the thumbholes inside gloves. Must have!</p>",
        "ggsrQ6FauHp_text": "<p>Exceptional quality and extreme comfort</p>",
